# `place floating` derives its row from the ground line and then subtracts
# `clearance`, so the perch hangs at a fixed height above whatever the terrain
# under it is doing — including over water, which is where they read best.
#
# The perch carries its own rock underside rather than assuming a floating
# island feature happens to be here: a landmark that only appears when two
# independent placement grids collide is a landmark nobody ever finds.

@struct sky_perch
name      "Sky Perch"
place     floating
rarity    0.4
weight    1.0
anchor    bottom_center
clearance 52
mirror    true
legend    c=S  block=stone
legend    c=D  block=dirt
legend    c=V  block=vine  soft=true
legend    c=L  block=goldOre|gemOre  mark=loot
legend    c=X  mark=spawn
body |
  ___SSSSS___
  __S.....S__
  __S..L..S__
  __S.X...S__
  __SSSSSSS__
  _DDDDDDDDD_
  __DDDDDDD__
  ___SSSSS___
  ____SSS____
  ____V.V____
